(Page 3: Semantic Search and FAISS) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Semantic search finds text that is conceptually similar to a query,) Tj
T* (not just textually similar. Each chunk of text is converted into a) Tj
T* (high-dimensional vector \(an embedding\). FAISS indexes these vectors) Tj
T* (so that, given a new query vector, it can quickly find the nearest) Tj
T* (neighbors -- the chunks most likely to contain the answer.) Tj
ET
endstream
